flowchart TD
  BSTART([Enter block<br/>target = cpu / gpu / mem-cpu /<br/>mem-gpu / combined]):::term
  SET[Set load level<br/>start 10%, raise by 10%]:::proc
  RUN[Apply load to target<br/>3 trials, hold to steady state]:::proc
  LOG[Record ΔT per zone, clocks,<br/>power, throttle margin<br/>+ GB/s for memory targets]:::proc
  RANGE{Temp OK?<br/>ΔT within 3σ band and < 90°C<br/>95°C = instant abort}:::dec
  THR{No throttle?<br/>thermal flag and<br/>over-current flag}:::dec
  COOL[Let it cool toward baseline<br/>fit τ from the decay curve]:::proc
  COOLED{Cooled in time?<br/>τ-based timeout x1.5}:::dec
  DONE{Reached full<br/>load 100%?}:::dec
  BPASS([Return PASS + metrics<br/>2-3σ deviations carried<br/>as WARN flags]):::term
  BFAIL([Return FAIL at level + cause<br/>thermal / power / cooling / band]):::abort

  BSTART --> SET --> RUN --> LOG --> RANGE
  RANGE -->|No - over 3σ or cap| BFAIL
  RANGE -->|Yes - 2-3σ = warn flag, continue| THR
  THR -->|No, throttled - log which flag| BFAIL
  THR -->|Yes| COOL --> COOLED
  COOLED -->|No, too slow| BFAIL
  COOLED -->|Yes| DONE
  DONE -->|No, raise load| SET
  DONE -->|Yes| BPASS

  classDef proc fill:#E1F5EE,stroke:#0F6E56,color:#04342C;
  classDef dec fill:#E6F1FB,stroke:#185FA5,color:#042C53;
  classDef abort fill:#FAECE7,stroke:#993C1D,color:#4A1B0C;
  classDef term fill:#F1EFE8,stroke:#5F5E5A,color:#2C2C2A;
